<td align="right"><h3>2026-05-26 11:51:15</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The notice of the 2026 annual general meeting to be held on June 10 will be sent to shareholders today May 26 and will be published on https://www.dngroup.com/nhst/.<br><br>On the agenda for the AGM is, i.a.:<br>- Approval of the 2025 financial statements<br>- Proposal for the re-election of Richard Olav Aa, Andrew Mullins and Dorthe Bjerregaard-Knudsen as Board members<br>- Proposal for the election of Baard Haugen as Board member<br>- Proposal for an adjustment of board remuneration<br>- Proposal to renew the existing authorization for the Board to issue new shares in the company<br>- Proposal to renew the existing authorization for the Board to acquire treasury stock.</p></td>
</tr>
