<td><h2>NHST Holding AS- annual financial statements 2022 and general assembly</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2023-04-20 17:01:04</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The Board of NHST Holding AS has approved the annual report and financial statements for NHST Holding AS and the group for 2022 for presentation to the Annual General Meeting.<br>The main numbers in the profit and loss statement and balance sheet are identical to those published in the financial report for the fourth quarter 2022, published on February 9, 2023.<br>The Board has decided that no dividends will be proposed for 2022.<br>The annual report for 2022 will be published on www.nhst.com in early May.<br>The annual general meeting will be held on June 14, 2023.</p></td>
</tr>
