<td><h2>NHST Holding AS- ordinær generalforsamling 2022</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-06-27 15:15:21</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>NHST HOLDING AS- GENERALFORSAMLING<br>Den 27. Juni er det avholdt generalforsamling i HST Holding AS.<br>Årsregnskapet for 2021 ble godkjent. <br>Ingen styremedlemmer var på valg.<br>Øvrige beslutninger var i henhold til styrets forslag.<br>-	Godkjennelse av fullmakt til erverv av egne aksjer<br>-	Godkjennelse av fullmakt til å kunne gjennomføre rettet emisjon<br>-	Valg av medlemmer til valgkomiteen<br><br>NHST HOLDING AS- ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING<br>The annual general meeting of NHST Holding AS was held on June 27th.<br>The annual financial statements for 2021 were approved.<br> No Board members were up for reelection.<br>Other decisions were according to the proposals from the Board.<br>-  Approval of authorization to acquire shares in the company<br>- Approval of authorization for issue of new equity without subscription rights<br>- Election of members of the nomination committee</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>NHST Holding annual report/årsrapport 2021</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-05-19 09:35:50</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>NHST Holding annual report 2021 published<br><br>The annual report for 2021 for NHST Holding has now been published on the company`s website www.nhst.com.<br>The financial numbers are identical to those published in the report for the fourth quarter 2021 on February 10.<br>The company has also published a Performance Report with supplemental information on the operations of the media business.<br>As previously announced, the annual general meeting will be held on June 27, 2022.<br><br>NHST Holding årsrapport for 2021 publisert<br><br>Årsrapporten for 2021 for NHST Holding er nå lagt ut på selskapets hjemmeside www.nhst.com.<br>Alle hovedtall er identiske med tallene i rapport for fjerde kvartal 2021 som ble publisert 10. februar.<br>Selskapet legger også ut en Performace Report med tilleggsinformasjon om driften av medievirksomheten.<br>Årets generalforsamling vil som tidligere annonsert bli avholdt 27. juni.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
