<td><h2>NHST Holding AS- annual financial statements 2021  and general meeting</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-04-26 08:25:22</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>NHST Holding AS- Årsoppgjør og generalforsamling <br><br>Styret I NHST Holding AS har godkjent årsoppgjøret for 2021 for NHST Holding konsern og morselskap for fremleggelse for generalforsamlingen.<br>Alle hovedtall i årsoppgjøret er identiske med tallene som ble publisert i rapport for fjerde kvartal 2021 den 10. februar.<br>Fullstendig årsrapport blir lagt ut på selskapet hjemmeside i nær fremtid.<br>Det blir ikke foreslått å dele ut utbytte for 2021.<br>Ordinær generalforsamling er fastsatt til 27. juni kl 1100<br><br><br>NHST Holding AS - Annual financial statements and general meeting<br><br>The Board of Directors of NHST Holding AS has approved the 2021 annual financial statements for the NHST Holding group and the parent company, for final approval by the company`s general assembly.<br>The main numbers are identical to the numbers published in the report for the fourth quarter 2021 on February 10.<br>The complete annual report will be published on the company`s website in the near future.<br>No dividends will be proposed for 2021.<br>The annual general meeting will be held on June 27 at 1100.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
