<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>NHST Holding AS - NHST Media Group makes investment in Norkon Computing Systems.</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-01-31 17:02:46</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Through its wholly-owned subsidiary NHST Media Group AS, NHST Holding (NHST) is participating with NOK 10 million in a new equity issue for Norkon Computing Systems AS (Norkon). <br>Norkon is a Norwegian real-time SaaS technology company specializing in products for the media and financial services industries.<br>Through the share issue, Norkon is raising NOK 25 million to finance its further growth. <br>Investors in the issues are Idekapital Fund 2 AS (Idekapital), participating with NOK 15 million, in addition to NHST Media Group. <br>Before the new issue, NHST owns 29,7% of the shares in Norkon through Dagens Næringsliv AS. Following the issue, the combined ownership interest of the NHST companies will be 31,7 %.<br>The issue prices Norkon at NOK 100 million prior to the issue. As part of the transaction, Norkon is issuing certain warrants to Idekapital and NHST to subscribe to further shares in the future.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Endring av aksje: NHST Media Group AS (NHST)</h2></td>
<td><h3>Corporate actions</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-12-08 11:53:05</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Det er foretatt endringer i NHST Media Group AS (ISIN:NO0005007807, ticker NHST).  Navnet NHST Media Group AS har endret navn til NHST Holding AS.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>NHST MEDIA GROUP AS- EKSTRAORDINÆR GENERALFORSAMLING/EXTRAORDINARY GENERAL MEETING</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-11-22 15:40:12</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Ekstraordinær generalforsamling ble avholdt i NHST Media Group AS den 22. november. Alle saker som fremgikk av innkallingen, ble vedtatt. Dette inkluderer:<br>-	Styrevalg. Som nytt styre ble valgt Anette Olsen, Christian Must og Anne Britt Berentsen<br>-	Endring av foretakets navn fra NHST Media Group AS til NHST Holding AS<br>-	Enkelt andre vedtektsendringer.<br>An extraordinary general meeting was held in NHST Media Group AS on November 22. All matters described in the notice of the meeting were approved. This includes:<br>-	Election of Anette Olsen, Christian Must and Anne Britt Berentsen as the new Board of Directors<br>-	Change of the name of the corporation from NHST Media Group AS to NHST Holding AS<br>-	Certain other changes in the Articles of Association</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>NHST MEDIA GROUP AS- EKSTRAORDINÆR GENERALFORSAMLING</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-11-08 16:24:28</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>NHST Media Group AS- ekstraordinær generalforsamling <br><br>Styret i NHST Media Group AS har besluttet å innkalle til ekstraordinær generalforsamling 22. november 2021 kl 0900.<br>Til behandling foreligger:<br>-	Valg av styremedlemmer<br>-	Endring av selskapets navn samt enkelte andre vedtektsendringer.<br>Innkalling sendes til alle aksjonærer med kjent adresse og legges ut på selskapets hjemmeside.<br><br>NHST Media Group AS- notice of extraordinary general meeting<br><br>The Board of Directors of NHST Media Group AS has decided to call for an extraordinary general meeting to be held on November 22 at 0900.<br>The agenda will be:<br>-	Election of Board members<br>-	Change of the company name and certain other changes in the Articles of Association<br>The full notice will be sent to all shareholders with known address and will be published on the Company`s website.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
