</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>NHST Media Group. IntraFish creates global market leader through acquisition of Heighway Group.</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2007-12-14 14:09:45</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>IntraFish creates global market leader through acquisition of Heighway Group.<br>IntraFish Media is the leading international source for seafood news. Through its Web sites (intrafish.com, intrafish.no, fiskaren.no) newspapers (IntraFish, Fiskaren) and IntraFish TV, the company provides news and analysis to seafood professionals worldwide. It is owned by NHST Media Group and A-pressen.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://www.nhst.no/news/pressreleases/article2812.ece">
http://www.nhst.no/news/pressreleases/article2812.ece</a>
